WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.086
Step 1. Open the schedule.

1.2
00:00:02.086 --> 00:00:06.746
Deleting a template also deletes its sessions and all their slots.

1.3
00:00:06.746 --> 00:00:11.553
Select Services, the service, then Schedule under Scheduling.

2.1
00:00:11.553 --> 00:00:16.459
Step 2. Open the template. On the template card, select the pencil icon.

2.2
00:00:16.459 --> 00:00:22.326
The Edit Schedule Template sheet opens, and the Delete button is inside this sheet.

3.1
00:00:22.326 --> 00:00:28.185
Step 3. Start the deletion. In the sheet, select Delete. Care asks Are you sure?

3.2
00:00:28.185 --> 00:00:33.793
and warns that this will permanently remove the scheduled template and cannot be

3.3
00:00:33.793 --> 00:00:34.784
undone.

4.1
00:00:34.784 --> 00:00:37.109
Step 4. Confirm the deletion.

4.2
00:00:37.109 --> 00:00:41.117
Select Delete, and Care shows Template has been deleted.

4.3
00:00:41.117 --> 00:00:46.556
A second message, Not Found, can follow, but the template is deleted.
